'''Sage of Life Dr. Nova''' (生命の賢者Dr.ノーヴァ, ''Seimei no Kenja Dr. Nōva'', '''Sage of Life Dr. Nova''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemy found in the [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Revival of Origin Invasion]] which appears after clearing all [[Uncanny Legends]] sub-chapters on 4-Crown difficulty. Completing the stage will unlock Dr. Nova's [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] counterpart, [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Dr. Nova]]. She was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

