==Enemy==
The true final boss of Uncanny Legends, Dr. Nova has an immense 5 million HP and massively damaging Long Distance attacks that are guaranteed to Slow and Curse targets hit, albeit with a blind spot that permits melee units to attack unopposed. As if that weren't enough, each hit also produces an [[Explosion]] that can more than triple her already high damage, extend the duration of her debuffs, and greatly expand her attack area, with the blast being wide enough to pierce into her own blind spot and destroy everything there even if she doesn't directly hit them. In addition, the debuff resistances granted by her Sage type make her considerably harder to push back or stall with [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|anti-Relic units]] like the [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]].

