==Trivia==
*''Nova'' is an astronomical term for a star that suddenly becomes much brighter and then returns to its original luminosity over a period of time. ''Nova'' is also the feminine form of the Latin word ''novus'', meaning "new".
*She may be based on various plant-related mythical humanoids such as the [[wikipedia:Dryad|dryad]], [[wikipedia:Hamadryad|hamadryad]] and [https://www.dandwiki.com/wiki/Alraune_(5e_Race) alraune].
*She may be the ancient god from the [[Uncanny Legends]] ending, as she appears in [[Sacred Forest]] and her description states that she guided the Cat Army to another dimension, while the Uncanny Legends ending states that an ancient god appeared from a golden tree and told the Cat Army to find a [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] in another world.
*Since her description says she wants to create perfect life, Dr. Nova is likely the master of [[Idi:Ne]], whose own Japanese description says her master's wish for the birth of perfect life is close to being realized.
**It is also implied that she had some involvement in the [[Laboratory of Relics]], and thus, every [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] enemy besides [[Zero Luza]].
*"The result of an ancient scientist's work to create a super-being to surpass humanity" appears to be a mistranslation. 成れの果て ''narenohate'' is an expression referring to the mere shadow of one's former self or the ruin of what one once was, but on its own, 果て ''hate'' means "end" or result", which may be what led to the confusing English localization. Since she has "Dr." in her name and is referred to as a researcher in her allied forms' descriptions, it's likely that Dr. Nova herself is a ruined scientist who worked to create a super-being (implied to be Idi:Ne), rather than being a separate scientist's creation.
*She is the first enemy to have the [[Explosion]] ability.
*She is the only Sage enemy to appear in Uncanny Legends.
*She has the highest health out of any [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] and tied with [[Sage of Selection Darvin]] for the highest health for any [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemy, and the third highest health of all enemies, behind [[Malevolent Eraser Cat]] and [[Nutcracker Witch (Enemy)|Nutcracker Witch]].
*She has a lower ID than Idi:Ne despite requiring more progress to encounter.

